  56:Generated_Source\PSoC5/AMux_ADC.c **** * Function Name: AMux_ADC_Select
  57:Generated_Source\PSoC5/AMux_ADC.c **** ********************************************************************************
  58:Generated_Source\PSoC5/AMux_ADC.c **** * Summary:
  59:Generated_Source\PSoC5/AMux_ADC.c **** *  This functions first disconnects all channels then connects the given
  60:Generated_Source\PSoC5/AMux_ADC.c **** *  channel.
  61:Generated_Source\PSoC5/AMux_ADC.c **** *
  62:Generated_Source\PSoC5/AMux_ADC.c **** * Parameters:
  63:Generated_Source\PSoC5/AMux_ADC.c **** *  channel:  The channel to connect to the common terminal.
